</div></details></div><div class="section-harvester" data-section="key_findings" style="--section-color:#a5b4fc"><details class="section-collapse" open><summary class="section-summary"><h2 id="pipeline-architecture">Pipeline Architecture</h2></summary><div class="section-body"><pre style="background:var(--color-bg);padding:16px;border-radius:8px;overflow-x:auto;font-size:0.85em;line-height:1.6">
